        faq: [{ question: "Is there a standard percentage of revenue firms should spend on marketing?", answer: "This varies significantly by practice area, growth stage, and competitiveness of the market — there's no single standard figure, and it's worth basing the number on the firm's own cost-per-case economics rather than an industry rule of thumb." }],
